   the improvement of coupling degree. By means of the establishment of a
   comprehensive evaluation index system and reverent coordination degree
   model, the paper estimated the coupling Degree in Prefecture-level
   Cities of Sichuan Province from 1998 to 2008. Compares the horizontal
   and vertical calculated results in different cities and years and
   provide reference for urban sustainable development. The results showed
   that the Coupling Degree between Urban Land Use Efficiency and
   Environment gradually increased, but the overall level is not higher.
   Only simultaneously way to improve the environment and land use
