Abstract = {China is a country with a large of mineral resources. There are a large
   number of mining sites in the industrialization process. With the
   gradual arrival of post-industrial era, the environmental treatment and
   ecological restoration of abandoned mines, the protection of mining
   heritages, the transformation of mining enterprises and resource-based
   cities attract wide attention. Based on the actual situation and
   analyses of the concept and development characteristics of Chinese
   National Mining Parks, the authors propose a series of core issues and
   related recommendations in planning and construction of Chinese National
   Mining Parks. This paper may provide some useful references for the
   construction and sustainable development of Chinese Mining Parks.},
