Organization = {Univ Aegean; Global Network Environm Sci \& Technol},
Abstract = {The study was conducted at Taxiarchi - Halkidiki in order to improve the
   area for sustainable development. Research area was surveyed for a
   regeneration study and utilization of the proposed land from the
   Prefecture of Municipality District of Polygyros at Taxiarchi.
   We used the sustainable development method for urban and mountainous
   areas in order to select appropriate structures based on the needs and
   requirements of both the residents and the visitors of Taxiarchi. The
   working method demanded the following steps: 1) field work and imprint
   it, 2) data transfer and office work, 3) processing the data and put
   them in a designing program, 4) final construction proposal for design
   and developing the area by making a recreation park with forest
   constructions - AUTOCAD program was used.
   The results of the study are: 1) the design of recreation was based on
   the method of sustainable use in order to select appropriate
   infrastructure and recreation, 2) the necessary infrastructure of the
   park and the planting combinations to achieve an excellent result were
   selected based on sustainability principles, 3) the recreation and the
   exploitation of the park differ from the initial study, due to
   construction and geotechnical problems, and 4) the construction project
   was off-budget.
   By planning environmentally we proposed the most of the structures that
   are going to be used inside the park to be controled under the EN
   legislation for non toxic colours, for using wooden or stone matterials.
   Actually using environmental friendly constructions; approves that we
   are working for the best interest of the community and the nature.},
