Abstract = {This is an important and urgent issue of urban sustainable development
   that industrial parks into Eco-Industrial Parks. This paper discusses
   how to carry out eco-transition in China industrial parks. It is thinks
   that China industrial parks should choose the path which the three level
   of inter-enterprise, inter industry and industry layer, and
   Eco-industrial Parks developed corporately. That is, promoting clean
   production continually and cutting pollution from the source in the
   aspect of enterprise, and building up the ecosystem industrial chain and
   then form industrial community according to the product integration,
   industrial integration, material integration and technique integration
   in the aspect of industry, and in the aspect of society attaching great
   importance to the control of the government and the function of the
   regulation through the market, and promote the intensive utilization of
   the regional resource, and advocate green assumption, also construct a
   circulation society completely.},
