   Ecosystem Development (EESED), Yunnan, PEOPLES R CHINA, AUG 21-23, 2015},
Abstract = {Green building is the core content of human habitat construction. The
   wind environment and nitrogen oxides of motor vehicle emissions of an
   urban community in Tianjin city were simulated based on the RNG
   k-epsilon turbulence and pollutant dispersion models. Three evaluation
   indices were proposed according to the regulatory requirements of green
   building and air quality standard of China. The satisfaction of these
   regulatory requirements for an urban community was evaluated under the
   condition of typical wind of different seasons. The results showed that
   the proposed evaluation indices can be used in the satisfaction
   evaluation of green buildings.},
