Abstract = {For efficiently judge the health degree of the corresponding to the
   urban environment and economy, we design a comprehensive evaluation of
   the urban environment and economic system, which involves air detection
   device, an information processing apparatus, environmental economic
   evaluation device. Detection means for detecting the air content in the
   air of SO2 and SO2 content of the value represented by the initial
   pressure and output; the information processing apparatus is connected
   with the air detection device, the initial pressure receiving its output
   value, and the integration process after output the final pressure
   value; environmental economic evaluation device connected to the
   information processing apparatus, information processing output device
   receives final pressure value, and a final pressure value and the
   measured value corresponding to the urban economy standard pressure
   value, and finally outputs the comparison result. Air detection device
   combined with the information processing apparatus, the starting
   pressure value measured for data processing to obtain a final pressure
   value and the standard pressure value for comparison, the final judgment
   of the health of the city. Research to improve the urban environment and
   promote sustainable development of urban environment to provide a
