   Acad Exchange Serv Fdn; TU Bergakademie Freiberg},
Abstract = {Along with the optimized utilization of leisure space and the
   optimization of leisure service facilities for elderly people in
   Beijing, the leisure life quality for the elderly has improved greatly.
   Through the investigation among 500 elderly people of Beijing in 2013,
   this paper constructed a leisure life quality evaluation index system
   for the urban elderly through factor analyses of the survey data. The
   influence factors of leisure experiences and leisure life quality of the
   elderly people could be summed up in five factors, i.e. leisure effect
   evaluation; recreational experience and leisure service in communities;
   recreational experience and leisure service in parks; senile leisure
   consumption; social interactions; and emotional needs. The authors used
   AHP to determine the weights of factors at all levels, and built the
   index system.},
