Organization = {Inner Mongolia Univ},
Abstract = {With the booming development of creative industries, the creative park -
   the spatial form of this new era-plays a fairly important role in modern
   urban life. Creative park not only performs the responsibilities of
   constantly making deep dialogue and communication between people and
   city's cultural life, but also makes a variety of types of space achieve
   regenerative transformation and functional transformation. After the
   early stages of development, the present problems the creative park face
   is how to survive with an attitude of sustainable development and a
   positive spatial development modes. This article aims to summarize some
   constructive developmental mode strategies on the basis of finished
   cases, which has certain positive and practical significance for the
   creative park space derived from the creative industries.},
