Pages = {160+},
Note = {International Conference on Urbanization and Land Reservation Research,
   Tianjin, PEOPLES R CHINA, SEP, 2009},
Organization = {Tianjin Univ Commerce; Tianjin Assoc Social Sci Circle},
Abstract = {In the process of urban development, many buildings were pulled down,
   the original streets were changed, the aboriginal people were moved to
   another place, the culture environment and culture balance was
   destroyed, and all the changes resulted in the original culture's
   rupture and death. From the view of the sustainable urban development,
   we should focus on the development of the original area culture, and
   make the urban regeneration integrated with the urban overall strategy.
   This paper examines the categories of urban knowledge, and provides the
   urban knowledge management model for urban regeneration, and gives
   several recommendations. Firstly; we should establish the knowledge
   classification during urban regeneration. Secondly, we should make
   definite the procedure of the knowledge management during urban
   regeneration. Thirdly, an example of the knowledge management
   recommendation scheme in Haihe River regeneration integrated project of
   Tianjin city in China is given. As designed in the scheme, Haihe River
   regeneration headquarters should conduct urban knowledge investigation
   and establish the urban knowledge repositories and determines five
   thematic objectives. Then the Haihe River regeneration strategic plan
   will be formulated and the Haihe River regeneration area will be divided
   into four functional zones.},
