Abstract = {As a countermeasure to the challenges of resource and environment in the
   fast urbanization, most cities choose green transformation as a
   necessary path to their development. By looking into the practices in
   question around the world, we have summarized three models of urban
   transition towards greening, namely, industrial reconfiguration, unique
   feature orientation and ecological development. Three cities are
   selected as examples to present the key components for urban
   transformation, followed by a comparison of their correlation and
   differences. It is expected that the findings would provide references
   and inspirations for other cities in the course of transition. (c) 2017
