Abstract = {In recent years, problems concerning the urban heat island have
   attracted much attention in terms of the widespread urbanization
   throughout Japan. The urban outdoor thermal environment in summer has
   become serious year by year. Various relaxation measures for urban
   thermal environment have been proposed and carried out with trial and
   error, because the effects of these counter measures have not been
   clarified enough. Numerical Simulation of outdoor thermal environment is
   expected as a powerful tool to estimate the effects of these counter
   measures before implementation. In this paper, the recent development of
   numerical Simulation method for outdoor thermal environment conducted by
   the author is introduced.},
